  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>glarity.app 收录数量只剩97.5万了，之前最多是2900万。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>eightify.app 只剩5.3万个了，之前最高是410万。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>看最近28天的流量变化，两家的流量都在下降。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这两家，都快摸到了千万的门槛，eightify.app 在3月流量开始下降，glarity.app 在4月流量开始下降。</div>\n<div>@阳光杉木 这是被惩罚后还可以申请复核吗？\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>不入金也可以</div>\n<div>看看网页供应量</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>9.35万个页面，算是很少了</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>如果用 allintitle 去查，数量更少</div>\n<div>kgr = 71/2560 = 0.0277 是很低的，可以做</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/a8ibng1qe0_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
